id=procspoof
name=ProcSpoof
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=1
author=Zodiac
description=Zygisk module that presents stock process state to selected apps: fake low parent PID (getppid>5000 fix), Seccomp:2 in /proc/self/status and prctl(PR_GET_SECCOMP), TracerPid:0, plus optional hiding of chosen processes from /proc and cgroup views. Configure via WebUI in KernelSU/MMRL.
